<!-- Settings > About (2026-11-19). The wording of the About page; John edits
     this file like a help file. The licence texts and the lists of programs,
     libraries, fonts and images are NOT typed here: they come from the
     licenses/ folder and are drawn into the marked places below
     (data-about="..." and data-about-table="...") by js/about_engine.js.
     Structure: three short sections everyone sees, then closed lines to
     open (COGA: no wall of legal text). No headings inside <summary>. -->

<section class="set-about-top" aria-labelledby="set-about-app-h">
    <h3 id="set-about-app-h">MetaForge Studio <span data-about="version"></span></h3>
    <p>Copyright © 2026 John Foliot. Proudly made in Canada.</p>
    <p>MetaForge Studio is free software. You may use it, copy it, change it and share it under the terms of the <strong>GNU General Public License, version 3 or later</strong>.</p>
    <p class="set-about-actions">
        <button type="button" class="set-secondary" data-about-text="GPL-3.0.txt" data-about-title="GNU General Public License, version 3">Read the licence</button>
        <a href="https://github.com/johnfoliot/MetaForge-Suite">Project page on GitHub</a>
    </p>
</section>

<section class="set-about-top" aria-labelledby="set-about-warranty-h">
    <h3 id="set-about-warranty-h">No warranty</h3>
    <p>MetaForge Studio changes your music files. It writes tags, renames files and folders, and converts audio.</p>
    <p>It comes with <strong>no warranty of any kind</strong>. Keep a backup of anything you can't replace.</p>
</section>

<!-- SUPPORT THE PROJECT: add this section when the donation link exists.
